      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "提高热机效率，使它接近最大可能的数值，是发展国民经",
        "济的重要技术任务。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例　题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1. 量热器中盛有 $m_1=0.2$ 千克，温度 $t_1=20^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$ 的水，再",
        "把 $m_2=0.3$ 千克，温度 $t_2=80^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$ 的水注入到量热器中，量热",
        "器中的平衡温度 $t=50^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$。量热器的热容量是多大？①"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "解：根据热平衡方程，在量热器中物体进行热交换的热",
        "量的总和等于零。温度 $t_2$ 的水放出热量 $cm_2(t-t_2)$，温度",
        "$t_1$ 的水吸收热量 $cm_1(t-t_1)$；量热器吸收热量 $C(t-t_1)$，因",
        "为它的初温等于水温 $t_1$。因此，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$cm_2(t-t_2)+cm_1(t-t_1)+C(t-t_1)=0.$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "由此得出"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$C=\\frac{cm_1(t_1-t)+cm_2(t_2-t)}{t-t_1}$；",
        "$C\\approx700$ 焦耳/度。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "2. 在气缸里，活塞下面充满质量为 $m=0.2$ 千克的二氧",
        "化碳气（$\\mu=0.044$ 千克/摩尔）。气体温度升高 $\\Delta T=88$ 开。此",
        "时气体做多少功？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "解：气体在一定的压强 $p$（由大气压和活塞产生）下膨",
        "胀。在这种情况下，功 $A'=p(V_2-V_1)$，式中 $V_1$ 和 $V_2$——气",
        "体的初体积和末体积。利用理想气体的状态方程 $(2-19)$，用",
        "温度来表示压强与体积的乘积：",
        "$pV_2-pV_1=\\frac{m}{\\mu}RT_2-\\frac{m}{\\mu}RT_1.$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": "footnote",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "①　在 § $22$ 中讨论量热器的实验时，我们忽略了量热器的热容量。"
      ]
    },
